      keywords: '["Evoke"]',
      oracle_text:
        'When this creature leaves the battlefield, create a 4/4 green Elemental creature token.\n' +
        "Evoke {4}{G} (You may cast this spell for its evoke cost. If you do, it's sacrificed when it enters.)",
